		"description": "<p>By tending to your ally when they need you the most, you allow them to overcome terrible struggles. Make a DC 15 Medicine check. On a success, your target is able to ignore one level of fatigue or strife for 1 minute. If you have a healer’s satchel or similar tool readied, they may also spend 1 hit die.</p>",
